abstract: "Deterministic #![no_std] f32 zero-heap 3-channel streaming anomaly detection engine (<15 KB static SRAM on ARM Cortex-M4F, 0 matrix inversions) featuring Sim+(d) Givens-QR canonicalization, Huber-clamped EMA / stable-plateau DC re-lock, dual-stage alarm gating, and on-chip zero-touch AutoCalBufF32 auto-warmup. Verified at Level 1 (algorithmic invariants) and Level 2 (offline SMD/PSM/OpenML replay and 5-target cross-compilation); Level 3 physical MCU silicon verification remains pending external hardware measurement."
